t:3","when":[],"effect":"review","reason":"تابع الخدمة المحددة في TAMM لتأكيد المستندات والموافقات قبل التقديم.","actions":["collect_or_verify_requirement"],"sourceRefs":["https://www.added.gov.ae/en/set-up/establish-your-business/licensing-requirements"]},{"id":"conditions","when":[],"effect":"review","reason":"يذكر دليل ADDED هذه المعاملة ضمن خدمات الترخيص. الرابط للإرشاد؛ تؤكد شروط الحالة والمستندات في خدمة TAMM المطابقة.","actions":["review_conditions"],"sourceRefs":["https://www.added.gov.ae/en/set-up/establish-your-business/licensing-requirements"]},{"id":"fees","when":[],"effect":"review","reason":"لا ينشر هذا الدليل رسمًا ثابتًا لهذه الحالة؛ تؤكد الرسوم النهائية داخل خدمة TAMM المختارة.","actions":["review_fees"],"sourceRefs":["https://www.added.gov.ae/en/set-up/establish-your-business/licensing-requirements"]},{"id":"duration","when":[],"effect":"review","reason":"لا يقدم الدليل مدة ملزمة لكل حالة؛ تحقق من مدة الخدمة والموافقات داخل المعاملة المختارة.","actions":["review_duration"],"sourceRefs":["https://www.added.gov.ae/en/set-up/establish-your-business/licensing-requirements"]}]},{"slug":"abu-dhabi-economic-license-amendment","sourceId":"70623092-6ce5-4f6d-80a2-f674cdb7bbef","authority":"added-abu-dhabi","url":"https://www.added.gov.ae/en/set-up/establish-your-business/licensing-requirements","requirementCount":3,"rules":[{"id":"requirement:1","when":[],"effect":"review","reason":"الدليل يحدد خدمة الترخيص؛ قائمة المستندات التفصيلية تؤكد في المعاملة المختارة.","actions":["collect_or_verify_requirement"],"sourceRefs":["https://www.added.gov.ae/en/set-up/establish-your-business/licensing-requirements"]},{"id":"requirement:2","when":[],"effect":"review","reason":"اختر المعاملة المطابقة وبيانات الرخصة أو الاسم التجاري حسب الحالة.","actions":["collect_or_verify_requirement"],"sourceRefs":["https://www.added.gov.ae/en/set-up/establish-your-business/licensing-requirements"]},{"id":"requirement:3","when":[],"effect":"review","reason":"تابع الخدمة المحددة في TAMM ل